{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prop-categorical-q-connection-unique","@type":["folio-assistant-core:Proposition","doco:Section"],"label":"prop:categorical-q-connection-unique","kind":"proposition","title":"Uniqueness of the categorical $q$-connection","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prop-categorical-q-connection-exists","papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prop-categorical-connection-unique"],"proofs":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prf-categorical-q-connection-unique"],"tags":["uniqueness","q-connection"],"leanRef":"qou:QOU.CategoricalQConnection.unique","text":"categorical-q-connection-unique.md","leanSource":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/categorical-q-connection-unique.lean","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"prop:categorical-q-connection-unique\"></a><p>For fixed <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\nabla</code>, <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\xi</code>, <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\varTheta</code>, and <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">q</code>, the categorical <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">q</code>-connection is uniquely determined. Up to gauge transformations, <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\nabla_q</code> inherits the gauge freedom of its base connection <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\nabla</code>.</p>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/categorical-q-connection-unique.md","leanStatus":"proved","heading":"Proposition","number":"3.18.5"}
